<title>USA: DeepTech unit gets $65 mln credit facilit.</title>
<headline>DeepTech unit gets $65 mln credit facilit.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>DeepTech International Inc said on Tuesday that its subsidiary, RIGCO North America LLC, has completed a $65 million credit facility with Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>The company said it retired all of its secured debt related to the acquisition of the company's two semisubmersible mobile offshore drilling rigs.</p>
<p>In addition, the new credit facility will provide funds to complete a major upgrade of a rig, the company said.</p>
</text>
